What is the output of the following parameter reassignment program?
```java
class PointPayload {
    int x = 10;
}
public class ParamReassignApp {
    static void reset(PointPayload p) {
        p = new PointPayload();
        p.x = 99;
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        PointPayload pt = new PointPayload();
        reset(pt);
        System.out.println(pt.x);
    }
}
```

