What is the output of the following swap attempt?
```java
class ContainerBox {
    String val;
    ContainerBox(String val) {
        this.val = val;
    }
}
public class BadSwapApp {
    static void swap(ContainerBox x, ContainerBox y) {
        ContainerBox temp = x;
        x = y;
        y = temp;
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        ContainerBox b1 = new ContainerBox("One");
        ContainerBox b2 = new ContainerBox("Two");
        swap(b1, b2);
        System.out.println(b1.val + ":" + b2.val);
    }
}
```

What is the output of mutating internal fields inside a method?
```java
class MutablePair {
    int a = 1, b = 2;
}
public class FieldSwapApp {
    static void swapFields(MutablePair p) {
        int t = p.a;
        p.a = p.b;
        p.b = t;
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        MutablePair pair = new MutablePair();
        swapFields(pair);
        System.out.println(pair.a + "," + pair.b);
    }
}
```

What is the output of the following chained aliasing with reassignment?
```java
class TagHolder {
    String name;
    TagHolder(String name) {
        this.name = name;
    }
}
public class ChainAliasApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        TagHolder t1 = new TagHolder("Alpha");
        TagHolder t2 = t1;
        TagHolder t3 = t2;
        t2.name = "Beta";
        t1 = new TagHolder("Gamma");
        System.out.println(t3.name + "-" + t1.name);
    }
}
```
